    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for mTLS connection factory. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Defines the contract for creating and establishing mTLS connections. Implementations should handle:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>TLS context configuration</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>TCP connection establishment</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>TLS handshake</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Error handling and diagnostics</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Thread-safe: implementations must be safe to call from multiple threads </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
